Somebody help me!

01:33:28.940 --> 01:33:30.000
Huh?

01:33:30.000 --> 01:33:37.360
Oh, now listen you keep this up, and I'll take your life, too

01:33:38.080 --> 01:33:40.080
Just let me live. I beg of you

01:33:42.320 --> 01:33:44.250
Here we go

01:33:44.250 --> 01:33:48.750
Trapped in the heart of darkness sheath that sword dipped in your evil soul

01:33:50.810 --> 01:33:56.110
Obey me or feel the hammer of justice. Where are you? Show yourself

01:33:56.110 --> 01:33:58.100
I'm right here

01:34:01.690 --> 01:34:16.280
- Hmm.

01:34:16.280 --> 01:34:16.930
- Hey.

01:34:16.930 --> 01:34:29.430
Hey.

01:34:29.430 --> 01:34:30.000
- Myself for what?

01:34:30.250 --> 01:34:33.230
A clumsy, half-wit, pint-sized acrobat?

01:34:44.030 --> 01:34:49.080
You can't get away with this, you ignorant little witch!

01:34:50.670 --> 01:34:52.690
Burst!

01:35:00.000 --> 01:35:09.030
rough it's a fit for anyone who stands against justice excuse me no need to thank me i couldn't

01:35:09.030 --> 01:35:16.590
stand by and let that thug get away with it his defeat is thanks enough oh yeah now then if you'll

01:35:16.590 --> 01:35:30.000
excuse me by any chance b do you work at a pet shop

01:35:30.860 --> 01:35:36.690
Now, what makes you think that I would work in a pet shop?

01:35:36.690 --> 01:35:39.230
You should never judge people by appearances.

01:35:39.230 --> 01:35:41.370
That would be very unjust!

01:35:41.370 --> 01:35:45.010
So it's better to assume someone works in a pet shop for no reason.

01:35:45.010 --> 01:35:47.760
Oh!

01:35:47.760 --> 01:35:48.870
Petsman?

01:35:48.870 --> 01:35:50.650
Yeah, yeah, I guess you could say that.

01:35:50.650 --> 01:35:55.190
Oh, please, sir, would you consider accompanying me on my journey for which I would gladly

01:35:55.190 --> 01:35:56.190
pay you?

01:35:56.190 --> 01:36:00.000
Well, we can talk about that, but let me ask you something first.

01:36:01.440 --> 01:36:04.960
What was all that jumpin' and hoppin' around all about?

01:36:04.960 --> 01:36:09.630
Heirs of Justice, Conker!

01:36:09.630 --> 01:36:10.730
Ah, see ya!

01:36:10.730 --> 01:36:19.640
AHH!

01:36:19.640 --> 01:36:21.990
No, Prince...

01:36:21.990 --> 01:36:26.130
Mm.

01:36:26.130 --> 01:36:27.010
Oh...

01:36:33.420 --> 01:36:35.760
What man do I feel like a loser right now?

01:36:35.760 --> 01:36:36.980
What a rip-off!

01:36:41.590 --> 01:36:43.210
That's better.

01:36:43.210 --> 01:36:57.450
Hmm, priest and a bandit traveling together?

01:36:57.450 --> 01:36:58.480
That's weird.

01:37:00.540 --> 01:37:03.330
Can I assume that you are a sorceress?

01:37:03.330 --> 01:37:05.970
Thank goodness.

01:37:05.970 --> 01:37:09.540
I wonder if I could ask for your help in a job I need done.

01:37:09.540 --> 01:37:14.010
You want me to get rid of the bandit boss who's with you?

01:37:14.010 --> 01:37:15.210
Bandit?

01:37:15.210 --> 01:37:16.250
Oh, no!

01:37:16.250 --> 01:37:18.250
Well, what's he supposed to be then, a dwarf?

01:37:18.250 --> 01:37:21.570
Look, would you just listen to what we have to say?

01:37:30.730 --> 01:37:34.800
Before we talk, I'd like to reveal my identity.

01:37:34.800 --> 01:37:41.680
Exactly.

01:37:41.680 --> 01:37:46.730
This man, traveling secretly with me,

01:37:46.730 --> 01:37:51.540
is none other than Crown Prince Filionel de Saerun.

01:37:51.540 --> 01:37:55.410
He's who?

01:37:55.410 --> 01:37:59.920
It is my honor to introduce Crown Prince Filionel de Saerun.

01:38:00.220 --> 01:38:04.840
- You're serious? - Quite serious.

01:38:04.840 --> 01:38:12.770
- Are you all right? - No, actually, I'm not.

01:38:12.770 --> 01:38:16.570
It isn't hard to understand why it comes as such a surprise to you.

01:38:16.570 --> 01:38:20.760
The Prince has been traveling secretly.

01:38:20.760 --> 01:38:24.060
That's not exactly why I'm surprised.

01:38:24.060 --> 01:38:27.860
I'm Randy, the Prince's attendant priest. May I ask your name?

01:38:27.860 --> 01:38:29.700
Lena. Lena Inverse.

01:38:30.000 --> 01:38:33.740
You mean I'm famous or something?

01:38:33.740 --> 01:38:37.730
Why, you're that little magic sorceress girl, aren't you?

01:38:37.730 --> 01:38:39.550
Lena the bandit killer!

01:38:39.550 --> 01:38:41.550
Yes, we've heard the rumors about you.

01:38:43.480 --> 01:38:46.950
Which rumors do you mean?

01:38:46.950 --> 01:38:50.140
Isn't that what you call yourself wherever you go?

01:38:50.140 --> 01:38:52.120
No, not really.

01:38:52.120 --> 01:38:55.280
Well then, you may call me Phil if you wish.

01:38:55.280 --> 01:39:00.000
It's probably best if we're not so formal while I'm traveling in Syria.

01:39:00.030 --> 01:39:04.780
Miss Lina, we need you to be our monster exterminator.

01:39:04.780 --> 01:39:06.600
Monsters?

01:39:06.600 --> 01:39:09.450
There's a cave nearby which is home to many monsters

01:39:09.450 --> 01:39:12.450
who've been attacking the surrounding villages lately.

01:39:12.450 --> 01:39:16.230
His Majesty heard of this situation while traveling

01:39:16.230 --> 01:39:19.230
and has decided, out of the goodness of his heart,

01:39:19.230 --> 01:39:21.570
to exterminate them.

01:39:21.570 --> 01:39:24.490
Such small villages don't have any soldiers

01:39:24.490 --> 01:39:26.490
to take care of the problem.

01:39:26.490 --> 01:39:30.000
And unfortunately, Randy won't be able to eliminate them.

01:39:30.000 --> 01:39:32.420
all the monsters single-handedly, so...

01:39:32.420 --> 01:39:35.410
But, Phil, you look like you could handle yourself in a fight.

01:39:35.410 --> 01:39:37.250
What do you mean by that?

01:39:37.250 --> 01:39:39.910
Why don't you fight the monsters?

01:39:39.910 --> 01:39:44.150
Oh, but this is just a disguise for traveling.

01:39:44.150 --> 01:39:46.130
My appearance must be very deceiving,

01:39:46.130 --> 01:39:51.090
because I assure you I'm a staunch pacifist.

01:39:51.090 --> 01:39:54.060
Uh, well, thanks a lot for the offer, Phil,

01:39:54.060 --> 01:39:56.460
but I don't think I need that kind of trouble.

01:39:56.460 --> 01:40:00.000
You would, of course, be rewarded for your trouble.

01:40:03.290 --> 01:40:04.870
It's no trouble at all.

01:40:05.510 --> 01:40:10.440
I'm hot.

01:40:10.910 --> 01:40:12.730
I'm so hot.

01:40:13.070 --> 01:40:15.390
Can't these stupid monsters come around when it's cooler?

01:40:15.590 --> 01:40:17.190
Is something wrong, Miss Lena?

01:40:17.940 --> 01:40:18.680
Hot.

01:40:18.900 --> 01:40:19.610
I'm hot.

01:40:19.730 --> 01:40:20.810
Now I'm all sweaty.

01:40:21.290 --> 01:40:24.030
You're hot from that stifling costume you're wearing.

01:40:24.330 --> 01:40:26.490
Just watch the cracks about the costume, bub.

01:40:27.520 --> 01:40:29.100
Take a bath.

01:40:29.420 --> 01:40:30.000
A bath?

01:40:50.990 --> 01:40:51.480
- Hello?

01:41:00.030 --> 01:41:05.090
Ah, feels great!

01:41:05.090 --> 01:41:07.170
Lina, is there anything wrong?

01:41:07.170 --> 01:41:09.170
What was that big explosion?

01:41:09.170 --> 01:41:10.160
Huh?

01:41:10.160 --> 01:41:11.160
Oh!

01:41:11.160 --> 01:41:14.980
Right!

01:41:14.980 --> 01:41:16.380
Oh!

01:41:16.380 --> 01:41:20.980
Just a reflex!

01:41:20.980 --> 01:41:29.550
Here it is!

01:41:31.560 --> 01:41:34.610
Looks like an old ruin. Maybe even somebody's tomb.

01:41:34.610 --> 01:41:43.780
The townspeople say there are dozens of monsters living in there now and that their boss stays somewhere all the way down at the bottom of the cave.

01:41:43.780 --> 01:41:46.710
I pull a mountain down with one shot!

01:41:46.710 --> 01:41:49.520
Don't go casting your reckless spells!

01:41:49.520 --> 01:41:52.660
You're still mad about what happened before?

01:41:52.660 --> 01:41:55.090
I healed you right back up, didn't I?

01:41:55.090 --> 01:42:00.000
First, we're going to try to reason with these creatures and perhaps they'll end their end.

01:42:00.000 --> 01:42:01.000
evil ways.

01:42:01.000 --> 01:42:07.530
I can't use my really big spells in a place this narrow.

01:42:07.530 --> 01:42:08.530
Really?

01:42:08.530 --> 01:42:16.490
Uh-uh.

01:42:16.490 --> 01:42:19.400
Get rid of these orcs with one spell shot, no problem.

01:42:19.400 --> 01:42:21.310
I'll try talking to them first.

01:42:21.310 --> 01:42:25.570
Does Phil know how to speak orcish?

01:42:25.570 --> 01:42:27.740
Not a word.

01:42:27.740 --> 01:42:30.000
Clear this path and permit us to pass.

01:42:30.220 --> 01:42:34.820
It is not my intention to do you harm, but if you fail to heed my warning,

01:42:35.040 --> 01:42:38.480
you will face the wrath of the brutal sorceress you see behind me.

01:42:38.620 --> 01:42:40.760
Hey, take it easy with that brutal stuff!

01:42:41.240 --> 01:42:43.020
Now, obey me!

01:42:44.410 --> 01:42:44.930
Go!

01:42:46.330 --> 01:42:50.040
See, I told you these foul creatures would listen to reason!

01:42:52.180 --> 01:42:54.520
And they didn't want to get fried.

01:42:56.080 --> 01:42:58.790
Forward, my friends! Forward!

01:43:03.610 --> 01:43:04.890
Stand aside!

01:43:04.890 --> 01:43:06.240
*grunt*

01:43:06.240 --> 01:43:09.130
The blasted monster must be deaf!

01:43:09.130 --> 01:43:10.660
This'll make him listen up!

01:43:10.660 --> 01:43:11.670
Huh?

01:43:11.670 --> 01:43:22.820
Are you from some royal family?

01:43:22.820 --> 01:43:26.060
Free stupid gag!

01:43:26.060 --> 01:43:28.200
Here comes a troll!

01:43:28.200 --> 01:43:29.120
*grunt*

01:43:34.600 --> 01:43:36.120
A salamander!

01:43:36.120 --> 01:43:37.940
Rye green!

01:43:37.940 --> 01:43:39.740
A vampire bat!

01:43:39.740 --> 01:43:41.740
A shardiste!

01:43:41.740 --> 01:43:46.360
She sure has a way of making a guy feel inadequate.

01:43:46.360 --> 01:43:57.210
See something up ahead!

01:43:57.210 --> 01:43:58.150
Just hide out.

01:43:58.150 --> 01:43:59.440
Let's find out.

01:44:00.800 --> 01:44:18.340
I've been waiting for you, Prince Filionell.

01:44:18.340 --> 01:44:30.000
You fiend, how do you know my name?

01:44:30.730 --> 01:44:33.950
As I was about to say, your journey ends here.

01:44:33.950 --> 01:44:38.770
How dare you, how dare you threaten a gentle soul like myself?

01:44:38.770 --> 01:44:39.650
Who's gentle?

01:44:39.650 --> 01:44:40.630
Huh?

01:44:40.630 --> 01:44:41.210
Huh?

01:44:46.980 --> 01:44:49.920
Now I've got you right where I want you.

01:44:49.920 --> 01:44:51.120
What?

01:44:51.120 --> 01:44:55.190
I'm tired of being third in line to the throne.

01:44:55.190 --> 01:45:00.000
And I'm tired of living my life in your overblown shadow, dear brother.

01:45:02.360 --> 01:45:03.780
You don't look alike.

01:45:03.780 --> 01:45:05.970
Is he?

01:45:05.970 --> 01:45:08.870
These royal families just never seem to get along, do they?

01:45:08.870 --> 01:45:10.320
Ha ha!

01:45:10.320 --> 01:45:15.120
My wizard here set a fine trap, and you fell right into it, brother.

01:45:15.120 --> 01:45:17.520
You mean to say the monsters are all--

01:45:17.520 --> 01:45:19.310
They're all my doing.

01:45:19.310 --> 01:45:22.310
So, what are you going to do when the kingdom is finally yours?

01:45:22.310 --> 01:45:25.210
Oh, I haven't really thought about that yet.

01:45:25.210 --> 01:45:25.930
Huh?

01:45:25.930 --> 01:45:28.540
You're just like a lot of guys who want to be king.

01:45:28.540 --> 01:45:30.000
I'll show you! Get 'em, guys!

01:45:36.300 --> 01:45:39.730
The justice shall strike it down!

01:45:39.730 --> 01:45:40.730
Huh?

01:45:40.730 --> 01:45:46.750
Against any fiend, be he even of my own family, my justice shall not waver!

01:45:46.750 --> 01:45:47.570
Amelia!

01:45:47.570 --> 01:45:48.940
Gary?

01:45:48.940 --> 01:45:52.100
Oh, this is... so embarrassing.

01:45:52.100 --> 01:45:53.100
Hi!

01:45:53.100 --> 01:45:57.430
Did she say "Hey, Daddy?"

01:46:03.130 --> 01:46:06.180
You're right, but she is my daughter Amelia.

01:46:37.930 --> 01:46:39.410
Uh, no way!

01:46:39.410 --> 01:46:42.650
Get out!

01:46:42.650 --> 01:46:52.670
Kid, are you the mercenary babysitter?

01:46:52.670 --> 01:46:58.150
I don't know. I met her on the road and she said she was looking for her father and wanted me to help her out.

01:46:58.150 --> 01:46:59.670
Why, you little...

01:47:00.280 --> 01:47:01.280
Come on!

01:47:01.280 --> 01:47:10.650
Come forth, our ally, Bross Demon Garudia!

01:47:10.650 --> 01:47:12.130
Pattycake boys did it.

01:47:12.130 --> 01:47:13.130
Are they good?

01:47:13.130 --> 01:47:14.010
They're not bad.

01:47:14.010 --> 01:47:18.960
Pools who conspire with the monster race, your hearts are stained with evil!

01:47:18.960 --> 01:47:24.200
I can't believe that my own brother would ally himself with such a monster to assassinate

01:47:24.200 --> 01:47:25.200
me.

01:47:25.200 --> 01:47:28.440
I'm sorry, but even a pacifist like myself can't let him get away with this!

01:47:28.440 --> 01:47:30.000
Hey, hold on!

01:47:30.000 --> 01:47:31.000
I don't want to handle this.

01:47:31.000 --> 01:47:32.000
Pass the fist crush!

01:47:32.000 --> 01:47:38.650
This is kick!

01:47:38.650 --> 01:47:40.660
This is weird!

01:47:40.660 --> 01:47:44.730
Oh, our friend Garundia!

01:47:44.730 --> 01:47:47.730
Don't panic, we'll call the other monsters!

01:47:47.730 --> 01:47:48.730
Hm.

01:47:48.730 --> 01:47:50.970
Come forth, our allies!

01:47:50.970 --> 01:47:56.210
Those fools!

01:47:56.210 --> 01:47:58.480
We've got to stop them!

01:47:58.480 --> 01:47:59.480
Let's do it!

01:48:00.510 --> 01:48:00.960
DEA-

01:48:00.960 --> 01:48:13.570
WILL TORGE MENCH SMASH!

01:48:13.570 --> 01:48:15.870
You can't stop me that easily!

01:48:15.870 --> 01:48:18.370
Come forth anybody!

01:48:18.370 --> 01:48:21.500
Give up your-

01:48:21.500 --> 01:48:25.960
I WILL be the king of Seirune!

01:49:01.340 --> 01:49:05.120
Oh Randy, you shouldn't have tried to overreach.

01:49:05.120 --> 01:49:06.100
Daddy!

01:49:06.100 --> 01:49:06.820
Hmm?

01:49:06.820 --> 01:49:08.320
Uh, you can put me down.

01:49:08.320 --> 01:49:11.010
Oh, I didn't realize.

01:49:11.010 --> 01:49:14.710
Amelia, what in the world are you doing getting mixed up in all of this?

01:49:14.710 --> 01:49:21.740
Daddies go away to travel in secret and get into all these neat adventures and you never tell me!

01:49:21.740 --> 01:49:23.740
That's no excuse for following me!

01:49:23.740 --> 01:49:27.150
Excuse me, Phil. Sorry to butt in like this.

01:49:27.150 --> 01:49:28.150
What is it?

01:49:28.150 --> 01:49:30.000
I... I... I...

01:49:30.120 --> 01:49:35.080
was just wondering if I could get that reward we talked about now well I'm

01:49:35.080 --> 01:49:41.330
afraid Randy was the one carrying all of the money maybe your daughter oh I'm

01:49:41.330 --> 01:49:45.070
afraid I don't have any money left I spent all of it trying to find my daddy

01:49:45.070 --> 01:50:00.000
here don't worry you'll get a handsome reward when we return to say rude ha well

01:50:00.000 --> 01:50:04.500
Perhaps this would be a good opportunity for my daughter Amelia to learn some magic from you along the way.

01:50:04.500 --> 01:50:06.500
It's an honor to be your pupil!

01:50:06.500 --> 01:50:09.400
And I wanted to meet a prince!

01:50:09.400 --> 01:50:16.930
And so Gowrie and I have two more travelers in tow.

01:50:16.930 --> 01:50:20.380
One's a mountain-sized bandit and the other's a loony hero-worshipper.

01:50:20.380 --> 01:50:21.880
Scratch that.

01:50:21.880 --> 01:50:24.930
They're really the peace-loving Prince Bill and...

01:50:24.930 --> 01:50:25.820
The Princess.

01:50:25.820 --> 01:50:27.680
A short-fused sorceress in training.

01:50:27.680 --> 01:50:29.670
By me.

01:51:30.600 --> 01:51:31.090
All right.

01:52:03.550 --> 01:52:07.080
Where monsters rampage, I'm there to take them down.

01:52:07.080 --> 01:52:10.240
Where treasure glitters, I'm there to claim it.

01:52:10.240 --> 01:52:18.320
Where an enemy rises to face me, victory!

01:52:18.320 --> 01:52:23.520
If you want to face it, if you want to fight for the first time,

01:52:23.520 --> 01:52:27.080
If you want to fight for the first time,

01:52:27.080 --> 01:52:29.000
I'll be in my face.

