and smashed their evil

01:54:11.590 --> 01:54:22.680
plot. By reward, Gal and I

01:54:22.680 --> 01:54:24.680
are traveling with Phil and Amelia as we make our way

01:54:24.680 --> 01:54:26.960
to Seirune. But I've got a feeling

01:54:26.960 --> 01:54:29.040
it's gonna be a long trip.

01:54:34.120 --> 01:54:36.120
Amelia's magic training.

01:54:36.120 --> 01:54:40.790
I'm exhausted.

01:54:40.790 --> 01:54:43.160
We've been walking for days.

01:54:43.160 --> 01:54:46.160
When are we ever gonna get to Saerun?

01:54:46.160 --> 01:54:48.960
With a heart filled with love for justice,

01:54:48.960 --> 01:54:51.960
the trip to Saerun isn't far at all.

01:54:51.960 --> 01:54:54.160
Yeah, whatever you say.

01:54:58.220 --> 01:55:00.000
Hey! Get out!

01:55:01.920 --> 01:55:07.040
According to this map, there should be a town just a short distance ahead.

01:55:07.040 --> 01:55:09.010
A town?

01:55:09.010 --> 01:55:15.730
Bandits!

01:55:15.730 --> 01:55:16.730
B-bandits?

01:55:16.730 --> 01:55:22.920
Oh my, Miss Lena, this isn't good!

01:55:22.920 --> 01:55:25.700
Don't worry, Phil, I'll take care of this!

01:55:25.700 --> 01:55:30.000
Uh, Amelia?

01:55:31.760 --> 01:55:38.990
Anybody who takes a deserted road like this one is begging to get robbed, so don't take this personally, my friend.

01:56:31.340 --> 01:56:37.620
Alright, little girl with the big mouth. Now we'll teach you not to get in our way.

01:56:37.620 --> 01:56:40.810
Okay, the show's over!

01:56:40.810 --> 01:56:41.810
Huh?

01:56:41.810 --> 01:56:45.330
Wow, do you need a lot more rehearsal?

01:56:45.330 --> 01:56:46.930
Don't joke with me!

01:56:46.930 --> 01:56:54.000
Sorry you don't appreciate my humor. Maybe you'll get...my punchline?

01:56:54.000 --> 01:56:59.000
That isn't very funny!

01:57:01.150 --> 01:57:14.520
pretty good did you say lena age about 15 or 16 fast hands even faster tongue

01:57:14.520 --> 01:57:20.520
dressed like a sorceress built like a beanpole then that's her lena the

01:57:20.520 --> 01:57:29.510
bandit killer you mean that stringy little thing

01:57:30.000 --> 01:57:36.350
Jerks! You think I'm going to let you go that easy after what you said about one bandit killer coming up!

01:57:36.640 --> 01:57:37.140
Dragon!

01:57:53.290 --> 01:57:53.810
Victory!

