02:26:32.200 --> 02:26:37.250
Oh, by the way, I'm not sure if I mentioned this.

02:26:37.250 --> 02:26:42.390
Be careful not to use any of your magic, or try to remove the circlet on your head,

02:26:42.390 --> 02:26:45.310
