02:27:09.960 --> 02:27:13.410
That girl's as stubborn as they come.

02:27:13.840 --> 02:27:15.720
The first thing she did was try to escape.

02:27:16.280 --> 02:27:18.580
They just don't know when to give up.

02:27:19.560 --> 02:27:20.470
No kidding.

02:27:21.910 --> 02:27:28.470
Just wait till I get out of here and get my hands on that guy.

02:27:28.710 --> 02:27:30.000
When I get through with him, he's going to be...

02:27:30.190 --> 02:27:34.850
he even heard the name lena inverse look you can complain all you want but

