my big sister used to put me through that was a piece of cake oh i didn't know you had a sister

02:28:41.890 --> 02:28:49.470
no didn't i tell you let's go let's go let's go let's go lose what are they doing

02:28:49.470 --> 02:29:00.000
what are you trying to do i'm trying

