Okay, Lena, don't move.

02:29:39.120 --> 02:29:49.840
Hmm, not too bad.

02:29:49.840 --> 02:29:53.280
Finish him off!

02:29:53.280 --> 02:30:00.000
We've been waiting for you.

02:30:00.000 --> 02:30:02.380
We're gonna teach you to put a price on our heads!

02:30:02.380 --> 02:30:05.010
Oh, can't you see how scared I am?

02:30:05.010 --> 02:30:06.390
Shut up and fight!

02:30:06.390 --> 02:30:08.100
I won't be fighting you.

02:30:08.100 --> 02:30:08.710
