02:30:08.710 --> 02:30:12.470
The one that you will face...

02:30:12.470 --> 02:30:13.950
...is me.

02:30:13.950 --> 02:30:17.760
So I guess that means I'm going up against you then.

02:30:17.760 --> 02:30:19.520
Now you're catching on.

02:30:30.800 --> 02:30:36.880
I've heard you were pretty good with the sword. I was hoping we'd face each other.

02:30:36.880 --> 02:30:39.760
Careful what you wish!

02:30:39.760 --> 02:30:42.700
FLA-

02:30:42.700 --> 02:30:47.480
ARROW!

02:30:47.480 --> 02:30:55.850
