02:30:55.850 --> 02:31:00.000
You didn't fall for that one. Looks like I gotta fight 'em.

02:31:02.560 --> 02:31:25.540
you're the first opponent who's ever even scratched me well you must have

02:31:25.540 --> 02:31:29.920
