02:31:55.750 --> 02:31:57.330
Heh heh heh heh heh.

02:31:57.630 --> 02:31:59.790
The demonic howling sword.

02:32:00.000 --> 02:32:03.270
Its roar can cut down any adversary.

02:32:03.270 --> 02:32:07.070
Well hey, I've got a special sword too.

02:32:07.070 --> 02:32:17.920
Light come forth!

02:32:17.920 --> 02:32:19.740
The Sword of Light.

02:32:19.740 --> 02:32:20.740
