02:34:00.120 --> 02:34:01.120
Oh, hi, Lena.

02:34:01.120 --> 02:34:02.590
You okay?

02:34:02.590 --> 02:34:06.480
We will retreat for today, but you haven't seen the last of us.

02:34:06.480 --> 02:34:08.480
I guess we're going to Syrog.

02:34:08.480 --> 02:34:11.360
If we don't find out who's behind those bounty hunters,

02:34:11.360 --> 02:34:14.330
we'll never know what's going on.

02:34:14.330 --> 02:34:17.250
I wonder who they are and why they're after us.

02:34:17.250 --> 02:34:19.550
That's right!

02:34:19.550 --> 02:34:20.500
That's not... Amelia!

02:34:20.500 --> 02:34:22.400
