02:35:08.550 --> 02:35:13.090
I don't want to see you back here for a loooong time!

02:35:13.090 --> 02:35:16.560
Don't worry! It's a long way to Sairai!

02:35:16.560 --> 02:35:18.210
Hold down the fort 'til we get back!
